   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till utsatta barn</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is focused on children and youth at risk, how to support them from an individual point of view considering their background and further needs. The project is going to be a cooperation between Union Local and Regional Governments and SALA-IDA in Sweden. Children and their families are in focus but also staff/politicians at local level.</narrative>
